    "summary": "Innovative and results-driven Senior Full Stack Engineer with 7+ years of experience designing, scaling, and maintaining distributed web applications and high-throughput microservices. Proven track record in reducing cloud infrastructure latency by 42% and orchestrating zero-downtime CI/CD pipelines. Passionate about clean architecture, developer productivity, and building resilient user experiences.",
